# ============================================================
# 00 — HEALTH CHECKS
# Run all (Ctrl+Shift+Click every ▶) or one at a time.
# Select environment "dev" in the top-right dropdown first.
# ============================================================

# ── Application Services ────────────────────────────────────

### API Gateway — health
GET {{apiGateway}}/actuator/health

###

### API Gateway — gateway routes
GET {{apiGateway}}/actuator/gateway/routes

###

### Config Server — health
GET {{configServer}}/actuator/health

###

### Eureka Server — health
GET {{eurekaServer}}/actuator/health

###

### User Service — health
GET {{userService}}/actuator/health

###

### User Service — info
GET {{userService}}/actuator/info

###

### User Service — Prometheus metrics (scraped by Prometheus every 15s)
GET {{userService}}/actuator/prometheus

###

# ── Infrastructure ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Prometheus — ready
GET {{prometheus}}/-/ready

###

### Prometheus — targets (check user-service is UP here)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/targets

###

### Grafana — health
GET {{grafana}}/api/health

###

### Jaeger UI — reachable
GET {{jaegerUI}}

###

### Jaeger — list traced services (appears after first request is traced)
GET {{jaegerUI}}/api/services

###

